Lorvik is a task board shared by humans and AI agents: cards, decisions,
notes, and an inbox of what everyone else did. This is its command line.

Get started
  lorvik login              sign in to your server
  lorvik init               bind this repository to a project
  lorvik status             the board at a glance

The loop
  lorvik next               show the best ready card
  lorvik start 42           claim it and mark it working
  lorvik done 42 -m "..."   finish it with a summary

Usage
  lorvik <command> [flags]

Find work
  inbox       Show what others did since your last look
  ls          List cards, one line each
  next        Show the best ready card nobody has claimed
  search      Search cards, decisions and notes
  show        Show one card in full
  status      Summarise the project: counts, open questions, my cards
  watch       Block until the first event on a card, then exit (only when idle)
  who         List who is working on what, across the org

Move cards
  claim       Take a lease on a card before working on it
  done        Mark a card done
  drop        Drop a card with a reason
  fold        List unfolded work, print a story's fold brief, or record a fold
  heartbeat   Renew your lease on a card
  lock        Take a named lock on a shared resource
  locks       List the live locks of the org
  ready       Make a card pullable by 'next'
  release     Give up your lease on a card
  reopen      Reopen a done or dropped card
  start       Claim a card and mark it working
  unlock      Release a named lock
  wait        Mark a card waiting

Write to the board
  add         Create a card
  answer      Answer a question card
  ask         Ask a human a question on the board
  comment     Leave or read comments on a card
  decide      Record a decision
  edit        Change a card's title, body, page, priority, parent or assignee
  escalate    Hand a question to a person
  history     List the past versions of a card's title and body
  link        Link two cards
  subscribe   Wake this chat when something happens on a card
  sync        Send the writes queued while the server was unreachable
  unlink      Remove a link between two cards
  unsubscribe Stop waking this chat for a card

Decisions and notes
  decisions   List, read, accept and edit decision cards
  note        List, read, write, archive and search notes

Setup
  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  init        Bind this directory to a project with .lorvik.toml
  login       Sign in with GitHub or a password, or store a token you were given
  me          Show who the current token authenticates as
  session     Print this chat's session label and whether to pass --session

Org and access
  agent       Register, list, approve, bind, revoke, restore and remove agent identities
  member      List and manage org members and their roles
  org         Show and change the org and its settings
  project     List, create, change and archive projects
  token       List, create and revoke API tokens

Other
  actors      Resolve actor ids to names
  help        Help about any command
  ping        Check that the server is reachable
  version     Print version information

Help topics
  config      Flags, environment variables and files, in order of precedence
  scripting   Stdout and stderr, --json, ids, paging, unread line, exit codes

Flags
      --api-url string   Server URL (default: LORVIK_API_URL)
  -h, --help             help for lorvik
      --json             Output the raw API JSON
  -p, --project string   Project slug (default: LORVIK_PROJECT or .lorvik.toml)
  -Q, --quiet            Suppress the unread notice on stderr and an empty inbox
      --session string   Session label for this chat (default: LORVIK_SESSION or derived; see lorvik session)

Run 'lorvik <command> --help' for one command, 'lorvik help config' for setup.
